[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1920.71, "timestamp": "00:32:00", "text": "说话的时候，我现在有胡子了。我快要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1923.11, "timestamp": "00:32:03", "text": "秃顶。我去健身房，所以我很友善"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1925.43, "timestamp": "00:32:05", "text": "现在肌肉发达。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1929.19, "timestamp": "00:32:09", "text": "嗯。所以，从物理角度来说，不行。但在网上，我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1930.801, "timestamp": "00:32:10", "author": "@MegaWashere23", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/zLzxXLffVwLKGsObDktU_-Y2fN57694onVxYip_7B74ZX0yHcfvZzth_c0OWl-Mn0K5g04Vn=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "dame dane"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1933.045, "timestamp": "00:32:13", "author": "@KonztellionHelper", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/GocLQxiJeUhcpFBwOECdYbCqbqHlCvz1B8j2gnfHQ1Q3AM1kFQ-eKqoi6TpMpyuxId3-6U94bcI=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Greetings Konzteller! MegaWasntHere~🌟 Welcome to the Guild! Make sure to read the Guildmate Guidelines in the description below before chatting further. Enjoy your stay!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1935.269, "timestamp": "00:32:15", "text": "是的。在网络上，你可以成为任何你想成为的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1939.029, "timestamp": "00:32:19", "text": "想。不，这正是它的魅力所在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1940.47, "timestamp": "00:32:20", "text": "比如，有人就问过我这个问题，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1942.47, "timestamp": "00:32:22", "text": "“为什么你的模特身上有胸部？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1944.63, "timestamp": "00:32:24", "text": "我当时就想，“听着，伙计。如果我要去……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1946.87, "timestamp": "00:32:26", "text": "坐在这里假装成另一个人，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1949.19, "timestamp": "00:32:29", "text": "我宁愿去看一些我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1953.509, "timestamp": "00:32:33", "text": "就像“好的。嗯，我会的。我喜欢动漫。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1956.549, "timestamp": "00:32:36", "text": "我和其他女生都喜欢看动漫女孩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1970.07, "timestamp": "00:32:50", "text": "而且还有很多类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1973.11, "timestamp": "00:32:53", "text": "我现在正在网上，我感觉就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1975.35, "timestamp": "00:32:55", "text": "所以，我喜欢我所做的就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1977.11, "timestamp": "00:32:57", "text": "每次有事发生，我都会把自己封闭起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1979.59, "timestamp": "00:32:59", "text": "就像一场戏剧之类的事情发生一样。"}]